{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06448","headline":"送刘主簿归金坛 · 李颀","name":"送刘主簿归金坛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"与子十年旧，其如离别何。\n宦游邻故国，归梦是沧波。\n京口青山远，金陵芳草多。\n云帆晓容裔，江日昼清和。\n县郭舟人饮，津亭渔者歌。\n茅山有仙洞，羡尔再经过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06448.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06448","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}